(II) relation lattice rank (=k-1) and block runs of extremizers:
    E=(0, 1, 2, 3, 4): rank Lambda = 4, runs = [[0, 1, 2, 3, 4]]
    E=(0, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 8): rank Lambda = 6, runs = [[0], [2, 3, 4, 5, 6], [8]]
