    blocks [(0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5), (0,)]: torus avg = 0.5292  | exact mu at scale 40->0.5212, 90->0.5221   (k=7)
    blocks [(0, 1, 2), (0, 1, 2)]: torus avg = 0.8500  | exact mu at scale 40->0.7007, 90->0.7007   (k=6)

